OL,3,AWater queues build as 8,500 without
OL,4,Asupply
OL,5,
OL,6,FSevern Trent said bottled water would
OL,7,Fbe available until 22:00 on Wednesday
OL,8,Fand every day until supplies were
OL,9,Frestored, but warned the complex repair
OL,10,Fcould take several more days.
